  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "坎",
      "text": "方位可参北，坎有水边、酒醋之旁的场所提示。若原行程与此相合，可先向经手方核那次收拾，询查宜把真实细节说透。",
      "sourceRule": "坎",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.120Z",
      "textSha256": "9c00ebbc58cb79d376380124041a84708cabfece7cd329bbda3b3309133932a0"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "东方是变震的传统方向，闹市、道路可供对照。若能按可信记录联系原停留处，可将物品记号给准，再问有无相应招领实物。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.121Z",
      "textSha256": "ba20800387c87b2a5ed185307db329804f04ac20df418ff67bc86ff2446c90ed"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "传统取象偏西北，场所见高处、圆器之中。若有人愿意配合查看，可先问原物是否确实放过那里，再核容器内的特征。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.121Z",
      "textSha256": "a044d5fa2dded41391aa2d432cad167da01fcf7a5d8be7130594dc6b5ce42be1"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "坎",
      "text": "北方及水边、鱼盐之地是变坎的线索。原经过若有相应店铺，可比较各条消息的亲见依据，托实际能看物件的人核收存。",
      "sourceRule": "坎",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.121Z",
      "textSha256": "898fd9c8ee6a7373778432b095d2616c8cf0de5697ffc94f9784f635dd344c31"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "方位取东方，场所参大途、闹市。若对某条答复较信任，也宜拿真实行程核对应停留点，再向原处问清实物记号。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.121Z",
      "textSha256": "83b22d56ae55b1eaa4007b4b4d13bfaf2be03e7d6afe8a0e27877e2b0cd80667"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "西北与圆器之中、高处属于变乾场所象。若等他人带来消息，可先把原来实际用过的收纳说清，收到回复后及时核所见物件。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:25:07.121Z",
      "textSha256": "e2ed11cee50c46316b4c8f90ab6557753331c0692256bfcc540f6c19fd2fa998"
    }
  ]
}
